{{Card Infobox|Cost=6|Rarity=Epic|Type=Troop|Arena=Jungle Arena|ReleaseDate=5 September 2018}}{{SubpageNavBox|Evolution=yes}}{{Quote|This jolly green Goblin Giant stomps towards enemy buildings. He carries two Spear Goblins everywhere he goes. It's a weird but functional arrangement.}}

The Goblin Giant is an {{Rarity|Epic}} [[Cards|card]] that is unlocked from the [[Arenas|Jungle Arena (Arena 9)]]. It spawns a single-target, [[:Category:Building Cards|building]]-targeting, melee, ground [[:Category:Troop Cards|troop]] with very high hitpoints and moderate damage. He also carries two [[Spear Goblins]] on his back, that can attack independently on the Goblin Giant. When he is defeated, the Spear Goblins spawn and continue attacking. He appears to be a colossal, aquamarine-skinned [[Goblins|Goblin]] wearing a brown aviator hat and pants with stitches, along with a backpack with ropes tied on the sides and team-colored suspenders, and has two ropes tied on his wrists, teal eyebrows, and a deep pink nose. A Goblin Giant card costs 6 [[Elixir]] to deploy.

