==History==
2018
*The Goblin Giant [[Cards|card]] was added to the game on 5/9/2018, in the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]].
*On 1/10/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/10/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Giant's hitpoints by 6%.
2019
*On 7/1/2019, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/1/2019)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Giant's hitpoints by 3%, and increased the range of the Spear Goblins in the backpack to 5.5 tiles (from 5 tiles).
*On 15/4/2019, the [[Version History#April%202019%20Update%20(15/4/2019)|April 2019 Update]], fixed a bug where the Goblin Giant's Spear Goblins would not despawn correctly if the Goblin Giant scored a [[Touchdown]], causing the Spear Goblins to remain intact and score a consecutive Touchdown immediately upon the beginning of the next round.
*On 1/7/2019, the [[Version History#July%202019%20Update%20(1/7/2019)|July 2019 Update]], decreased the Goblin Giant's range to 1.2 tiles (from 1.25 tiles), now classified as Melee: Medium.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Goblin Giant's card info screen.
2020
*On 9/12/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (9/12/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Giant's attack time interval to 1.5 seconds (from 1.7 seconds), and his first attack time interval to 0.8 seconds (from 1 second).
2021
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2023
*On 7/2/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Change%20(7/2/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the attack time interval of the Spear Goblins in the backpack to 1.5 seconds (from 1.7 seconds).
*On 4/4/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(4/4/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Spear Goblins' range to 5.5 tiles (from 5 tiles).
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
*On 8/8/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(8/8/2023)|Balance Update]], increased the Goblin Giant's hitpoints by 6%.
*On 13/11/2023, a [[Version History#Minor%20Update%20(13/11/2023)|Minor Update]], fixed a bug where [[Clone|cloning]] a Goblin Giant would spawn floating bodyless Spear Goblins.
*On 13/12/2023, the [[Version History#Tower Troop Update (13/12/2023)|Tower Troop Update]], increased the attack time interval of the Spear Goblins in the backpack to 1.7 seconds (from 1.5 seconds).
2024
*On 5/3/2024, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/3/2024)|Balance Update]], decreased the Goblin Giant’s hitpoints by 3.2%.
*On 17/6/2024, the [[Version History#Goblin World Update (17/6/2024)|Goblin World Update]], decreased the Spear Goblins’ first attack time interval to 0.3 seconds (from 0.5 seconds). It also added the Goblin Giant to the Goblin class.
*On 1/7/2024, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/7/2024)|July 2024 Update]], added the Goblin Giant’s Evolution.
2025
*On 8/1/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (8/1/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Spear Goblins’ first attack time interval to 0.4 seconds (from 0.3 seconds).
*On 30/1/2025, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (30/1/2025)|maintenance break]], made it so that [[Rune Giant]]'s damage boost would no longer affect the Goblin Giant's Spear Goblins.
*On 31/3/2024, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Goblin Giant's hitpoints by 0.03%. It also fixed a bug where Spear Goblins would not spawn after being buffed by [[Royal Chef]].
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] increased the Spear Goblins’ first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.4 seconds) {{Balance|Nerf}}, and decreased their range to 5 tiles (from 5.5 tiles) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2025)|Balance Update]], increased the Backpack Spear Goblins' first attack time interval to 0.5 seconds (from 0.4 seconds), decreased their range to 5 tiles (from 5.5 tiles) and decreased the Goblin Giant's hitpoints by 7%.

